  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 16-layer planar dielectric stack on a Ge (Icenogle) substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS (16 layers total, alternating starting with ZnSe (Querry) at the air side). Each layer thickness is an independent optimization variable with bounds 400-1200 nm. Target: maximize transmittance in 8000-11000 nm wavelength band while minimizing transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. Assume normal incidence, unpolarized light. Use coherent transfer matrix method across the full 3000-11000 nm spectrum. Materials zns, ZnSe (Querry), and Ge (Icenogle) must be resolved from the local material registry.",
